---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Badge from "../../components/Badge.astro";
import { languages } from "../../i18n/ui";
import { getLocale } from "../../i18n/utils";

export function getStaticPaths() {
  return languages.map((lang) => ({
    params: { lang: lang.code },
    props: { lang: lang.code },
  }));
}

const lang = getLocale(Astro.props.lang);

const provider = {
  name: "Thorsten Riedel",
  street: "Lerchenstraße 40",
  city: "74172 Neckarsulm",
  country: "Deutschland",
  email: "Tribun692000@gmx.de",
  phone: "+49 170 7424561",
  phoneHref: "+491707424561",
};

const lastUpdated = "31. Oktober 2026";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for FlowMatrix – information on data processing, hosting and your rights under the GDPR."
  lang={lang}
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <Badge tone="emerald">Rechtliches</Badge>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-pretty text-slate-400">
      Information on the processing of personal data when using this website
      pursuant to Art. 13 and 14 GDPR.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-10 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">1. Controller</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          The controller responsible for data processing on this website is:
        </p>
        <address class="mt-3 not-italic">
          <p class="font-medium text-white">{provider.name}</p>
          <p>{provider.street}</p>
          <p>{provider.city}</p>
          <p>{provider.country}</p>
          <p class="mt-2">
            E-Mail:
            <a
              href={`mailto:${provider.email}`}
              class="text-brand-300 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-brand-200 hover:underline"
            >
              {provider.email}
            </a>
          </p>
          <p>
            Telefon:
            <a
              href={`tel:${provider.phoneHref}`}
              class="text-brand-300 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-brand-200 hover:underline"
            >
              {provider.phone}
            </a>
          </p>
        </address>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">2. Hosting</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          This website is hosted by Cloudflare Pages, a service of Cloudflare,
          Inc., 101 Townsend St., San Francisco, CA 94107, USA. Cloudflare
          processes connection data on our behalf and is contractually obliged
          to comply with the GDPR. The legal basis is Art. 6 (1) (f) GDPR
          (legitimate interest in a secure and reliable presentation).
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Cloudflare may process data outside the EU/EEA. Appropriate safeguards
          are in place through the EU Standard Contractual Clauses and
          Cloudflare's Data Processing Addendum.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">3. Server log files</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          The provider of the pages automatically collects and stores
          information in so-called server log files, which your browser
          automatically transmits to us. These are:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
          <li>Browser type and version</li>
          <li>Operating system used</li>
          <li>Referrer URL</li>
          <li>Hostname of the accessing computer</li>
          <li>Time of the server request</li>
          <li>IP address</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3">
          This data is not merged with other data sources. Collection is based
          on Art. 6 (1) (f) GDPR to ensure trouble-free operation and to detect
          abuse. Logs are deleted after 30 days at the latest.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">4. Cookies</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          This website does not set cookies and does not use analytics,
          advertising or tracking services. No consent banner is therefore
          required.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">5. Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          If you contact us by email or via a contact form, your details,
          including the contact data you provide, will be stored by us for the
          purpose of processing the request and in case of follow-up questions.
          The legal basis is Art. 6 (1) (b) or (f) GDPR. We delete this data as
          soon as it is no longer required, unless statutory retention
          obligations apply.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">6. External links</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          This website contains links to external websites. When you click such
          a link, the operator of the target website may process personal data.
          We have no influence on this processing. Please refer to the privacy
          policy of the respective provider.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">7. Your rights</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Within the framework of the applicable legal provisions, you have the
          right at any time to:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
          <li>Access your stored personal data (Art. 15 GDPR)</li>
          <li>Rectify incorrect data (Art. 16 GDPR)</li>
          <li>Erase your data (Art. 17 GDPR)</li>
          <li>Restrict processing (Art. 18 GDPR)</li>
          <li>Data portability (Art. 20 GDPR)</li>
          <li>Object to processing (Art. 21 GDPR)</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">
          8. Right to complain to a supervisory authority
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          You have the right to complain to a data protection supervisory
          authority about the processing of your personal data. The responsible
          authority is:
        </p>
        <address class="mt-3 not-italic">
          <p class="font-medium text-white">
            Der Landesbeauftragte für den Datenschutz und die
            Informationsfreiheit Baden-Württemberg
          </p>
          <p>Lautenschlagerstraße 20</p>
          <p>70173 Stuttgart</p>
          <p>Deutschland</p>
        </address>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">
          9. SSL/TLS encryption
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          For security reasons and to protect the transmission of confidential
          content, this site uses SSL/TLS encryption. You can recognize an
          encrypted connection by the fact that the browser's address bar
          changes from "http://" to "https://".
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">
          10. AI-generated content and liability
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Large parts of the content on this website – including workflow
          guides, premium PDFs and insights – are created with the help of
          artificial intelligence (AI). AI-generated content may contain
          errors, inaccuracies, outdated information or incomplete
          instructions.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          We do not guarantee that the content is correct, complete or up to
          date. The content is provided for general information only and does
          not constitute professional, legal, financial or technical advice.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          To the extent permitted by law, we exclude liability for any damages
          arising from the use of, or reliance on, AI-generated content. This
          exclusion does not apply to intent, gross negligence, injury to life,
          body or health, or to liability under mandatory statutory provisions.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Always verify critical steps and test code in a safe environment
          before using it in production.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">
          11. Changes to this privacy policy
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          We reserve the right to adapt this privacy policy so that it always
          complies with current legal requirements or to implement changes to
          our services. The new privacy policy applies to your next visit.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
